  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Girls&#x2019; Education Skills Partnership (GESP) is the UK&#x2019;s first public-private education partnership of its kind. It will provide high-quality and market-relevant skills training to girls and young women aged 13-25 in Nigeria and Bangladesh, through which they will become entrepreneurial and employable in sectors such as information technology, manufacturing, and other STEM-related fields.</narrative>
  </description>
